[h1]Island Airfields 2.1 - Separate Revolution Addon[/h1]
Planes and helicopters can land on owned island airfields, receive hangar service and launch on a new order.

[h2]What's new[/h2]
[list]
[*]A separate addon for stock CC2 and Revolution 1.6-19. Enable the original Revolution mod and Island Airfields together.
[*]No Revolution files, complete game screens or private gameplay DLL are included.
[*]SDK 0.8.1 applies our small, version-checked screen changes in memory. Installed and Workshop files stay untouched.
[*]Individual and group landing orders preserve Revolution's map controls and ordinary ground-unit routes.
[*]Carrier flight-deck indications check the actual destination carrier, excluding island landings and other carriers' traffic.
[/list]

[h2]Install[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe to Island Airfields and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3833014670]CC2X SDK[/url].
[*]Close the game. Copy the SDK's [b]content/dinput8.dll[/b] beside [b]carrier_command.exe[/b]. Preserve a backup of a known older CC2X DLL; check compatibility before replacing a different loader.
[*]Enable Island Airfields in Mods and restart.
[/olist]
With Revolution, also subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3460002110]the original Revolution 1.6[/url] and enable [b]both mods[/b]. No combined repack is required. Without Revolution, enable Island Airfields normally.

Required runtime: [b]CC2X SDK 0.8.1-client-beta.1[/b]. Older SDKs lack the required combined capabilities. Workshop downloads do not automatically replace a manually copied DLL. ModLoader must explicitly support this exact runtime before automatic installation.
[url=https://github.com/Dioramawhois/-CC2X-island-airfields/blob/main/workshop/installation/README.md]Installation guide with screenshots[/url]

[h2]How to play[/h2]
[list]
[*]Land: give an airborne aircraft one waypoint near an owned airfield.
[*]Launch: give a parked aircraft a new waypoint away from the island.
[*]Cancel: replace the order before touchdown.
[/list]
Owned airfields are marked immediately in team colour. Planes and helicopters are enabled by default. Only the host runs the flight policy; landing requests use the game's replicated waypoint channel.

[h2]Beta scope[/h2]
Windows, reviewed CC2 1.5.18-r2 and Revolution 1.6-19 screen profiles. Unknown screen versions are skipped and logged. Ordinary-host gameplay was accepted in the earlier integration prototype. The new separate delivery passes actual-SDK source/syntax checks and synthetic gameplay/UI fixtures; fresh separate-addon gameplay, a second remote client and dedicated servers remain unverified.

Include SDK/game versions, enabled mods, reproduction steps and cc2x.log with reports.
[url=https://github.com/Dioramawhois/-CC2X-island-airfields]Source and compatibility details[/url]
Owned code: GPL-3.0-or-later. Revolution remains a separate third-party mod.
